Kitchen

The cottage kitchen, low and warm, with a black iron stove. The door to the towpath is east, the parlour west, the stairs go up.

A pair of town boots stands by the stove, clean. Hester Reed, Amos's daughter, is here. Ivo Marsh, the toll clerk, is here.

Exits: east, west, up.

Ivo Marsh goes east.

